          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
          "align": "left",
          "spaceBefore": 0,
          "spaceAfter": 2,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "indent": 0,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Each factor can be made by choosing a power for each prime, from zero up to its maximum power.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For the prime 2, you can choose powers of 0 or 1.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For the prime 3, you can choose powers of 0, 1, or 2.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Therefore, there are ",
